      "filename": "Living History Exhibits at Lincoln Boyhood National Memorial, Indiana (1206e586-75d0-4131-94a0-cae6dd50033a).jpg",
      "title": "File:Living History Exhibits at Lincoln Boyhood National Memorial, Indiana (1206e586-75d0-4131-94a0-cae6dd50033a).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/02/Living_History_Exhibits_at_Lincoln_Boyhood_National_Memorial%2C_Indiana_%281206e586-75d0-4131-94a0-cae6dd50033a%29.jpg",
