      "description": "White marble grave marker, rectangular at the bottom, comes to a point at the top. Text: Nancy Hanks Lincoln mother of President Lincoln, died Oct 5 AD 1818 Aged 25 years, erected by friend of her martyred son 1879. Green grass all around, trees and iron fence in background.  Pennies on the ground in front of the grave.\nThe white marble headstone marks the grave of Abraham Lincoln's mother, Nancy Hanks Lincoln.  Nancy died on October 5, 1818.  She was 36 years old.\nKeywords: Abraham Lincoln; cemetery",
